🎬 Story Summary — Spoiler-light

The story goes back to the period when Guddu and Bablu Pandit are working under Kaleen Bhaiya and helping expand his criminal empire. At the same time, Munna Tripathi's jealousy and hunger for power continue creating tension inside the Tripathi family.

A new major threat emerges in the form of Babban Babua Yadav, a powerful gangster from Rajasthan. He wants to challenge Kaleen Bhaiya's control and gets political support while planning his move against the Mirzapur empire. This takes the conflict beyond Uttar Pradesh and into Rajasthan.

The movie essentially becomes a power struggle between rival gangs, mixed with family rivalry, revenge, loyalty and political manipulation. Guddu, Bablu, Munna and Kaleen Bhaiya all have different ambitions, so alliances become increasingly complicated.

In one line:

Kaleen Bhaiya's empire faces a new challenger while Guddu, Bablu and Munna get caught in an increasingly dangerous battle for power.
